        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Hello, I saw you again. I'm Ikurumi, a game scenario writer.\n\nDo you know the previous work \"Masque of Fantasy Murder Case\"? Half a year since that incident. This time, it's called \"Kairokan\" It happened in a strange building built in the middle of the sea. Let me introduce the case.\n\nThe mansion built by the former chairman of a famous construction company. The story begins when you are invited to the inauguration event. 7 invited guests who visited. The master doesn't show up.\nAnd a strange building that encompasses everything. What kind of events will be held?\n\nAnd the incident happens.\n\nA serial murder that occurs in a closed building under the sea.\nWho on earth is the culprit...!?\nAnd what is the trick hidden in this building!?",
